<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to make savings provisions in respect of
certain entitlements of members of the Legislative Council who ceased to be
members by virtue of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Constitution (Legislative Council) Amendment Act
1991</i></name></legref> to ensure equality of treatment of those former
members.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e232b58a-a607-4278-a34c-51c75d6ea500"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_dc6703a2-e080-48c2-bc05-e310ff7ba357"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1993-019"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Constitution (Legislative Council Reconstitution) Savings
Act 1993</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_43356748-8548-459e-a001-9b4eac8f994c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_665242f8-a5bb-4ec6-8f0d-b8021204ca68"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is taken to have commenced on 1 July
1991, being the date on which the 1991 reconstitution Act
commenced.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c0528929-a4c0-4ff5-bbb3-7ed1f47b409e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_97b0b1df-3175-413d-9b61-6dfce71b509e"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Object of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The object of this Act is to ensure equality of
treatment of the 3 former members of the Legislative Council who ceased to be
members as a consequence of the reconstitution of the Legislative Council in
1991 and, in particular, equality of treatment under the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1971-053"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Parliamentary Contributory Superannuation Act
1971</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_76357da1-3cb4-4043-bc4a-72ca8970a6aa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_3d1438dd-757c-4a01-83e5-d1c5dda2c06b"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_921f2b5e-44e8-4c65-85aa-9c68ff9457a4"
id="def.formermember"><b><i>former member</i></b></defterm> means a person to
whom this Act applies.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_68b740e3-eb04-4d98-b104-9cf8440f7c52"
id="def.the1991reconstitutionAct"><b><i>the 1991 reconstitution
Act</i></b></defterm> means the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Constitution (Legislative Council)
Amendment Act 1991</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eadce69a-d393-4135-ad8a-2e6e57c829ca"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_d032a234-dbe1-4e01-9c0d-55b27053e4d4"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Former members to whom Act applies</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act applies to a person who ceased to be a
member of the Legislative Council because of the operation of section 17 (3)
of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-1902-032"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Constitution Act
1902</i></name></legref>, as inserted by the 1991 reconstitution
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_51d3281d-b4f0-438b-a61e-7329dfdb9e82"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f96c8d0f-a19c-45e7-a6bd-062284c14414"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Saving in respect of former members</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_97099486-927b-46b2-a93d-8bd38e247b56"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1971-053"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Parliamentary Contributory Superannuation Act
1971</i></name></legref>, each former member is, on the commencement of the
1991 reconstitution Act, taken to have been entitled to salary in respect of
an aggregate period of 7 years.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2b2d11da-9883-46f9-8052-3600f16d5145"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 20 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-1971-053"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Parliamentary
Contributory Superannuation Act 1971</i></name></legref> applies to a former
member whose entitlement to a pension under that Act depends on the operation
of this Act as if the period of three months referred to in section 20 (2) (a)
of that Act commenced on the date of assent to this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4ad5c551-e450-4a47-96d1-b77bc56c63fc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section does not apply to or affect:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_454da0c3-9d50-4b4e-824d-d397c8518629" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a former member who was, on the commencement of
the 1991 reconstitution Act, entitled to salary in respect of an aggregate
period of more than 7 years, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_647242e0-af22-40cd-a0f5-355b8a7e9729" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a former member who has accepted a refund of
contributions or a supplementary benefit after ceasing to be a
member.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ec49289d-a783-477b-879e-5914e4b8e0fe"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_e92b7d96-5c0a-4c15-b5c7-5a4d29b244ce"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Other entitlements to compensation etc not
affected</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not affect any entitlement of a
former member (except an entitlement under the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-1971-053"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Parliamentary
Contributory Superannuation Act 1971</i></name></legref>) that is in the
nature of compensation or otherwise for ceasing to be a member because of the
operation of section 17 (3) of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-1902-032"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Constitution Act
1902</i></name></legref>, as inserted by the 1991 reconstitution
Act.</txt></block></level>
</content>


